
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.DerezObject(ID: uuid, flags: number): boolean`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llDerezObject(key ID, integer flags);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Derezzes an object previously rezzed from within the object containing the script.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) which is TRUE for success or FALSE for failure.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>ID / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Parameters/id" target="_blank">id</a></td>
          <td>The ID of an object in the region.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>flags / flag</td>
          <td>Deletion options.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim_inventory</li>
        <li>rez</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">509</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Specification</h2>
  <p>Deletes, or marks temp, an object that was previously rezzed by this script. The object's root prim must have been previously rezzed from a script within this object.
If the object is successfully deleted this function returns TRUE, if it fails for any reason it returns FALSE.</p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Constant</th>
        <th>Value</th>
        <th>Description</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=DEREZ_DIE&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">DEREZ_DIE</a></td>
        <td>0</td>
        <td>Immediately delete the object.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=DEREZ_MAKE_TEMP&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">DEREZ_MAKE_TEMP</a></td>
        <td>1</td>
        <td>Mark the object as temporary so that the simulator will remove the object at a later time.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=DEREZ_TO_INVENTORY&action=edit&redlink=1" target="_blank">DEREZ_TO_INVENTORY</a></td>
        <td>2</td>
        <td>Returns the targeted object to derezzer's inventory and saves its current state.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The targeted object's rezzer must be the same as the object hosting this script</li>
    <li>The target must not be an attachment</li>
    <li>The target must be copyable</li>
    <li>The target's owner must be the same as the script's owner.</li>
    <li>When marking an object as temporary, the object must not contribute to the navmesh.</li>
    <li>When using DEREZ_TO_INVENTORY there are a few other restrictions:
    <ul>
      <li>The derezzer must not be an attachment.</li>
      <li>The derezzer must be modifiable.</li>
      <li>The object in the derezzer's inventory must still exist.</li>
      <li>The object in the derezzer's inventory must not be a coalesced object.</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
function integer llDerezObject( key id, integer flag );
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      